WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:05.590
Here's how to install PadForge, add a virtual controller, and give it your pad.

2
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:07.730
You're hearing a generated voice.

3
00:00:09.150 --> 00:00:13.300
Download the win-x64 zip from the latest release on GitHub.

4
00:00:14.030 --> 00:00:17.620
It holds PadForge.exe, and nothing else.

5
00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:20.400
Extract it to any folder and run it.

6
00:00:20.910 --> 00:00:24.920
Windows asks for administrator permission each time PadForge starts.

7
00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:28.560
On the Dashboard, click Add Controller.

8
00:00:29.875 --> 00:00:31.045
Pick Xbox.

9
00:00:31.755 --> 00:00:36.025
Almost every PC game with controller support reads Xbox-style input,

10
00:00:36.255 --> 00:00:37.585
so pick it when you're not sure.

11
00:00:38.825 --> 00:00:41.675
Plug in your controller and open the Devices page.

12
00:00:42.305 --> 00:00:45.975
Select your pad, then click your slot under Virtual Controller Assignment.

13
00:00:46.605 --> 00:00:48.395
Click it again to take the pad off.

14
00:00:48.845 --> 00:00:51.795
You can also drag the pad onto your controller in the sidebar.

15
00:00:52.165 --> 00:00:54.995
Or take it off, and drag the controller onto the pad.

16
00:00:55.425 --> 00:00:59.235
The first time, PadForge installs its driver on its own.

17
00:00:59.685 --> 00:01:03.395
A recognized pad comes mapped, so the slot is ready to play.

18
00:01:06.387 --> 00:01:09.977
To check it, open the slot's Mappings tab and move a stick.

19
00:01:10.427 --> 00:01:13.277
The Value column shows exactly what the game gets.

20
00:01:14.587 --> 00:01:18.497
If a game reacts twice to every press, it sees both pads.

21
00:01:19.207 --> 00:01:23.217
Install HidHide in Settings, then tick Hide from Games on your pad.

22
00:01:23.707 --> 00:01:26.717
A pad you assign after the install comes ticked.

23
00:01:26.987 --> 00:01:29.077
With no double input, you don't need it.

24
00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:32.360
That's it.

25
00:01:32.510 --> 00:01:34.380
Your game now sees an Xbox controller.

26
00:01:34.970 --> 00:01:37.160
Find more guides at padforge.org.
